+            <td valign="top"><b>Data Requirements</b></td>
+            <td><ul><li>Device instance identifier (e.g., UDI, serial number) and device type</li><li>Device maintenance / last technical inspection date</li><li>Patient identity for each subject the device was used on</li><li>Measurement values and time of each <code>Observation</code> produced by the device</li><li>Time-bounded association/usage record linking device to patient</li><li>Practitioner who performed the measurement (optional)</li></ul></td>
